---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="Information about data handling on the Hireorbits informational website and contacting the company."
>
  <PageHeading
    eyebrow="WEBSITE INFORMATION"
    title="Privacy policy"
    description="How this informational website handles your visit and the information you choose to share."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose legal-copy">
      <p class="muted-note">Last updated: 14 September 2026</p>
      <h2>Visiting this website</h2>
      <p>
        This website presents information about Hireorbits Solution Private Limited. It does not
        provide user accounts, collect information through web forms, or use advertising trackers or
        analytics scripts. Fonts and website assets are served with the site.
      </p>
      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The website is currently hosted on GitHub Pages. The hosting provider may process technical
        request information, including IP addresses, to deliver and secure its services. Read the{' '}
        <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
          GitHub Privacy Statement
        </a>{' '}
        for its practices.
      </p>
      <h2>Contacting us</h2>
      <p>
        Email links open your email application. If you send an enquiry or CV, you choose what to
        include, and that message is handled through the relevant email services rather than a form
        on this website. Please include only information relevant to your enquiry and avoid
        unnecessary sensitive information.
      </p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        LinkedIn and other external websites operate under their own privacy policies. Following
        those links takes you to their services.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions about your information</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about information you have shared with Hireorbits, including requests to
        correct or delete it, contact <a href="mailto:info@hireorbits.com">info@hireorbits.com</a>.
        This notice describes the current website; any future application or data collection service
        will need its own applicable privacy information.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
